    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "After entering expenses, the next step is to generate a spreadsheet."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "Once the spreadsheet is generated, the request can be approved or disapproved."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If the request is not approved, the process goes back to entering expenses."
    },
    {
