      "content": "However, if the request is approved, the expenses can be paid out."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "The process then checks again if the request is approved or not."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "If it is not approved, the process goes back to entering expenses."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "But if it is approved, the expenses can be paid out."
    },
